- `detective-woman-1-avatar_redraw.svg`
- `detective-woman-1-avatar_redraw.png`
- `detective-woman-1-avatar_redraw-48.png`

Nothing was registered under `icon_set/model/icons`, `published/` was not touched, and I didn't run the build or gallery updates.

